## History

pyvoa is the third name of one continuous project, developed throughout by the
same authors:

  CoCoA  Covid Collaborative Analysis, 2020
         started during the Covid Hackathon of April 2020
         https://github.com/tjbtjbtjb/CoCoA (public, archived)
  PyCoA  Python COVID Analysis, 2020–2025
         https://github.com/coa-project/pycoa (no longer public)
  pyvoa  Python Virus Open Analysis, since 2025
         https://github.com/pyvoa/pyvoa

Earlier contributions are recorded in the git histories of those repositories.
CHANGELOG.md carries a summary of both, which is the only public record of the
pycoa years.

